er-involved shooting thomas  grabbed a gun  and told his girlfriend  he was going to do something to get the  police  to shoot him  i will now show you the body worn camera  videos from the officer involved  shooting  [Music]  show me your hands  [Music]  show me your hands  show me your hands  [Music]  here's some slow motion video  of thomas exiting the vehicle and he  reaches  for his waistband  3250 nortonea suspect vehicle  is going to be at a stop 32.50 north  tanea guys  body worn camera from officer luke  [Music]  hands out  stay out  stay out  down  get down  show me your hands  [Applause]  [Music]  god  despite being struck by the vehicle  you'll see thomas  stands back up  and he points his firearm at sergeant  graham's  direction  which is when officer lukak  engaged him in gunfire  there's a better view of it  okay  this concludes the briefing  are there any questions  was mr thomas a career criminal uh  before that day where he  uh did the four crimes all in one day  was he had he had previous history  he did have some previous history but  that will be provided to you after the  press conference  sir i just want to double check you said  that the investigation found that the  suspect did not fire his gun  that's correct he pointed it at the  people in the store he pointed it at  the people inside the bank  and then he pointed it at the police  officers  okay  thank you very much

